<title>UK: RESEARCH VENTURE FORMED BY SBC WARBURG AND MG.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH VENTURE FORMED BY SBC WARBURG AND MG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBC Warburg and Metallgesellschaft (MG) said on Friday they had come to an agreement for the two companies to cooperate in the provision of research on metals markets.</p>
<p>Under the terms of the agreement SBC Warburg, the investment banking division of Swiss Bank Corporation, and Metallgesellschaft Ltd, a subsidiary of MG Handel and a ring dealing member of the London Metal Exchange, will produce and research to clients of both companies under the name of SBC Warburg/Metallgesellschaft Metals Research.</p>
<p>The joint venture will commence in August and will deliver a number of products which draw on the complementary research and trading strengths of the two firms, the statement added.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542-8075</p>
